1
00:00:27,340 --> 00:00:29,800
Why? Why?

2
00:00:31,400 --> 00:00:33,440
You've trapped me for a thousand years.

3
00:00:33,440 --> 00:00:34,800
Let me in.

4
00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:37,260
Why won't you let me go?

5
00:00:45,700 --> 00:00:48,680
The right to reincarnate cannot be transferred.

6
00:00:49,100 --> 00:00:50,200
Right?

7
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:53,060
I don't know either.

8
00:00:54,460 --> 00:00:55,140
I'm sorry.

9
00:00:55,960 --> 00:00:58,000
I just wanted to save my daughter.

10
00:01:00,240 --> 00:01:02,370
You've been lying to me from the start.

11
00:01:03,840 --> 00:01:07,370
Weren't you willing to become an evil spirit for your daughter?

12
00:01:07,500 --> 00:01:08,200
Fine.

13
00:01:08,720 --> 00:01:09,920
I'll grant your wish.

14
00:01:24,300 --> 00:01:25,600
Who exactly are you?

15
00:02:16,020 --> 00:02:17,079
Come in.

16
00:02:27,100 --> 00:02:28,660
Where did you go today?

17
00:02:32,560 --> 00:02:33,360
Nowhere.

18
00:02:34,060 --> 00:02:35,240
Before fulfilling the agreement

19
00:02:35,240 --> 00:02:36,460
with your father,

20
00:02:36,600 --> 00:02:37,460
I cannot leave.

21
00:02:46,400 --> 00:02:47,660
You should rest early.

22
00:02:48,200 --> 00:02:49,060
I'll get going.

23
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:51,500
Where are you going?

24
00:02:54,020 --> 00:02:55,820
I'm going to find a place to stay.

25
00:02:56,420 --> 00:02:58,220
If you haven't found a place yet,

26
00:02:58,820 --> 00:03:00,280
you can keep staying here.

27
00:03:06,220 --> 00:03:07,620
I... I'm too tired today.

28
00:03:08,760 --> 00:03:09,860
I'm going to rest.

29
00:03:14,420 --> 00:03:15,800
Make yourself at home.

30
00:04:22,420 --> 00:04:23,260
Don't go.

31
00:04:32,760 --> 00:04:33,800
Don't leave me.

32
00:04:39,040 --> 00:04:40,080
Fate is cruel.

33
00:04:41,180 --> 00:04:42,980
I can't believe you are Tang'er.

34
00:04:43,980 --> 00:04:45,510
For a whole thousand years,

35
00:04:46,100 --> 00:04:47,500
I have finally found you.

36
00:04:48,560 --> 00:04:49,760
From now on,

37
00:04:50,400 --> 00:04:52,860
I will not let you suffer the slightest harm.

38
00:04:53,480 --> 00:04:54,180
Even if

39
00:04:55,280 --> 00:04:56,820
it costs my life.

40
00:05:11,060 --> 00:05:11,840
Attorney Gu.

41
00:05:11,840 --> 00:05:14,170
Mr. Lin arranged this especially for you.

42
00:05:14,260 --> 00:05:16,600
See if there's anything you're not satisfied with,

43
00:05:16,600 --> 00:05:17,960
or if you need anything else.

44
00:05:17,960 --> 00:05:20,020
Manager Li, actually I can...

45
00:05:20,160 --> 00:05:22,490
This is a token of Mr. Lin's appreciation.

46
00:05:22,960 --> 00:05:25,160
Please bear with us in your future work.

47
00:05:28,800 --> 00:05:31,730
I'll leave you to it. Let me know if you need anything.

48
00:05:54,700 --> 00:05:55,960
He really values you.

49
00:05:56,260 --> 00:05:57,500
What should I do?

50
00:05:57,620 --> 00:05:59,420
I'm a little afraid to continue.

51
00:06:02,200 --> 00:06:04,200
Isn't this exactly what you wanted?

52
00:06:08,300 --> 00:06:09,360
Take a look at this.

53
00:06:15,100 --> 00:06:17,740
It seems I thought things were too simple.

54
00:06:20,860 --> 00:06:22,000
Go back and tell him

55
00:06:22,300 --> 00:06:24,560
that I will absolutely not accept a private settlement.

56
00:06:24,560 --> 00:06:26,560
I will definitely take him to court.

57
00:06:26,760 --> 00:06:28,290
Yingying, calm down first.

58
00:06:28,300 --> 00:06:29,480
How can I calm down?

59
00:06:29,800 --> 00:06:31,260
He ruined me.

60
00:06:32,560 --> 00:06:34,360
If you have any conscience left,

61
00:06:34,620 --> 00:06:36,200
don't bother me anymore.

62
00:06:36,260 --> 00:06:38,320
I have nothing to talk about with you.

63
00:06:40,300 --> 00:06:41,560
Actually, I'm not here today

64
00:06:41,560 --> 00:06:43,100
to speak for Lingze.

65
00:06:43,860 --> 00:06:44,990
I'm here to help you.

66
00:06:48,159 --> 00:06:49,320
Ridiculous.

67
00:06:49,320 --> 00:06:51,460
I think you're all working for him.

68
00:06:51,600 --> 00:06:53,600
I'm not, and I never will be.

69
00:06:58,960 --> 00:07:00,020
Look at this first.

70
00:07:01,900 --> 00:07:03,140
The fact is that

71
00:07:03,140 --> 00:07:05,420
no matter what reason you use to sue him,

72
00:07:05,700 --> 00:07:08,230
he can always find a way to escape punishment.

73
00:07:08,700 --> 00:07:09,220
Doing this

74
00:07:09,220 --> 00:07:11,260
will only cause you more harm.

75
00:07:12,100 --> 00:07:13,900
He's an absolute monster.

76
00:07:14,380 --> 00:07:15,000
This...

77
00:07:17,220 --> 00:07:18,260
What should I do?

78
00:07:24,800 --> 00:07:26,660
Drop the charges against Lingze.

79
00:07:27,260 --> 00:07:30,660
I will fight for the maximum financial compensation for you.

80
00:07:31,460 --> 00:07:32,400
Please trust me.

81
00:07:32,700 --> 00:07:33,600
Work with me,

82
00:07:33,900 --> 00:07:35,030
and I'll avenge you.

83
00:08:02,600 --> 00:08:04,460
I understand why you are worried.

84
00:08:04,800 --> 00:08:07,560
It is indeed dangerous to be with that scumbag.

85
00:08:10,860 --> 00:08:12,720
If I really had to be with someone like that,

86
00:08:12,720 --> 00:08:14,180
it would be so disgusting.

87
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:16,420
I'd rather die.

88
00:08:24,200 --> 00:08:25,260
I'll get rid of him.

89
00:08:27,000 --> 00:08:29,060
I thought you couldn't fight people?

90
00:08:31,900 --> 00:08:33,220
Then I'll think of another way.

91
00:08:33,220 --> 00:08:34,220
Gather evidence.

92
00:08:35,059 --> 00:08:37,460
Anyway, stay away from that guy from now on.

93
00:08:40,620 --> 00:08:42,080
But I finally found

94
00:08:42,080 --> 00:08:43,610
a chance to get close to him.

95
00:08:43,820 --> 00:08:45,220
How can I give up halfway?

96
00:08:49,860 --> 00:08:51,920
I have no confidence at all right now.

97
00:08:58,600 --> 00:08:59,620
You will help me,

98
00:09:01,060 --> 00:09:01,780
right?

99
00:09:10,620 --> 00:09:12,460
I will help you with anything.

100
00:09:28,600 --> 00:09:29,340
I'm ready.

101
00:09:29,900 --> 00:09:30,480
Let's go.

102
00:09:36,700 --> 00:09:37,500
Come in.

103
00:09:44,640 --> 00:09:47,160
Is the new office okay?

104
00:09:47,500 --> 00:09:48,600
It's great.

105
00:09:48,860 --> 00:09:51,620
I just feel like I still don't deserve it.

106
00:09:52,660 --> 00:09:53,820
You deserve it.

107
00:09:55,160 --> 00:09:56,290
Thank you, Mr. Ling.

108
00:10:00,220 --> 00:10:00,820
By the way,

109
00:10:01,020 --> 00:10:03,350
that girl has agreed to settle privately.

110
00:10:04,400 --> 00:10:06,280
Really? That was fast.

111
00:10:06,600 --> 00:10:09,600
It's just that we might have to pay more compensation.

112
00:10:10,160 --> 00:10:11,360
Money isn't an issue.

113
00:10:16,820 --> 00:10:18,760
You always surprise me.

114
00:10:23,460 --> 00:10:24,900
About us,

115
00:10:26,620 --> 00:10:28,080
have you thought about it?

116
00:10:29,420 --> 00:10:30,220
Mr. Ling,

117
00:10:30,500 --> 00:10:31,400
I always thought

118
00:10:31,400 --> 00:10:32,840
you were joking.

119
00:10:33,420 --> 00:10:34,880
I never joke

120
00:10:34,880 --> 00:10:36,280
about this kind of thing.

121
00:10:37,100 --> 00:10:38,040
Isn't it

122
00:10:39,180 --> 00:10:40,400
too fast?

123
00:10:42,700 --> 00:10:43,500
Alright then.

124
00:10:44,300 --> 00:10:45,700
Think about it some more.

125
00:10:45,700 --> 00:10:46,660
I'll wait for your answer.

126
00:10:46,660 --> 00:10:47,040
Um,

127
00:10:47,040 --> 00:10:47,640
actually,

128
00:10:51,220 --> 00:10:54,000
I think I can give it a try.

129
00:10:55,200 --> 00:10:56,000
Really?

130
00:11:03,600 --> 00:11:04,960
Xingcan, trust me.

131
00:11:05,500 --> 00:11:06,960
I will definitely make you

132
00:11:06,960 --> 00:11:08,760
the happiest woman in the world.

133
00:11:09,220 --> 00:11:11,480
I'll introduce you to my father tonight.

134
00:11:13,260 --> 00:11:13,860
Tonight?

135
00:11:21,620 --> 00:11:22,900
Hello, President Ling.

136
00:11:22,900 --> 00:11:24,160
Hope you've been well.

137
00:11:24,200 --> 00:11:25,300
Hello, hello.

138
00:11:36,560 --> 00:11:37,840
Welcome, Mr. Zhao.

139
00:11:39,860 --> 00:11:41,440
How is it? Are you satisfied?

140
00:11:41,440 --> 00:11:42,460
Very satisfied.

141
00:12:22,820 --> 00:12:23,820
Your invitation.

142
00:12:24,600 --> 00:12:26,060
We are together.

143
00:12:26,200 --> 00:12:27,000
No.

144
00:12:29,360 --> 00:12:30,860
Don't worry. I'm here.

145
00:13:03,460 --> 00:13:05,820
This is highly collectible.

146
00:13:21,700 --> 00:13:23,220
Sorry I'm late.
